"""Static marketing copy (FAQ etc.)."""
FAQ = [
    ("How do I get a price?", "Use the instant quote calculator: choose the destination, enter weight and (optionally) dimensions, pick a service level and add insurance if you want it. Prices are calculated from the greater of actual and volumetric weight, so enter box dimensions for the most accurate figure."),
    ("What is volumetric weight?", "It is the space your parcel takes up, calculated as length × width × height (cm) ÷ 5,000. Carriers charge for whichever is greater: the real weight or the volumetric weight. Packing tightly in a right-sized box lowers your price."),
    ("Where do you ship from and to?", "All shipments are collected in Russia (or dropped at our hub) and sent to destinations listed in the quote tool. Some destinations cannot be served because of sanctions, export-control law or carrier restrictions, and we may decline any shipment where the law requires it."),
    ("How long does delivery take?", "Estimated transit times are shown in your quote for each service level (for example Express vs Economy). They start from pickup and exclude weekends and public holidays. They are estimates, not guarantees, and can be affected by weather, flight capacity and the customs authority of the destination country."),
    ("How do I track my parcel?", "Enter your RWC- tracking number on the Track page. You'll see a live timeline of every scan and status update. You don't need an account to track a parcel."),
    ("How do I pay?", "You pay the shipping fee yourself when you book, securely through Paystack (cards and local payment methods available on your Paystack account). Your parcel progresses once Paystack has confirmed the payment to our server."),
    ("Who pays import duties and taxes?", "Import duties and taxes, where they apply, are set by the destination country's customs authority and collected by that authority or its official delivery carrier. RusWorld Courier does not charge recipients any release or clearance fee through this website, bank transfer, crypto or gift cards."),
    ("Someone asked me to pay a 'release fee' for my parcel. Is that real?", "Treat it as a scam. We will never ask a recipient to pay a release fee via this site, bank transfer, cryptocurrency or gift cards. Check your tracking number on this site and contact us using the details on the Contact page."),
    ("What can't I ship?", "Dangerous goods, weapons, illegal drugs, cash, counterfeit goods and many other items are prohibited or restricted. See the Prohibited & Restricted Items page before you book; you must confirm compliance at booking."),
    ("What if my parcel is damaged or lost?", "Report it within the time limits in our Claims Policy by opening a support ticket with your tracking number and photos. Declared value with insurance determines the maximum compensation."),
]
